a.rawg.io/media/screenshots/650/65012af6adc94b405eedad5bfe54274c.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST\nAbout the GameThe legendary Choice of Life franchise returns in a new game! The gray concrete walls of the living cell, closing the hermetic door at the sound of a siren - all this is commonplace in Gigastructure. Everything here goes its way, until the block is isolated in search of a secret object...Key features of the new game: Unique setting, based on the universe of Gigastructure Cool 2D-illustrations, from the best artists Non-linear plot, where every choice can have unpredictable consequences"}